# ===== ch5.6: 127 strings =====

    old "Kirche, let's go through that dance one more time, from the beginning!{#ch5_6_v2999}"
    new "そのダンス、もう一度最初から行くわよ！"

    old "Yes! Kirche-sama!{#ch5_6_v1949}"
    new "はいっ！\\nキュルケさん！"

    old "Oh, darling!{#ch5_6_v3000}"
    new "あら、ダーリン！"

    old "H- Hiraga-kun!{#ch5_6_v1950}"
    new "ひ、平賀くん！"

    old "Did I disturb you?{#ch5_6_v9932}"
    new "邪魔しちゃったかな？"

    old "Hehe, it's fine. If it's you, darling, it's fine.{#ch5_6_v3001}"
    new "うふふ、いいのよ。\\n別にダーリンなら。"

    old "You practiced so hard, I couldn't bring myself to call out to you.{#ch5_6_v9933}"
    new "ずいぶんと熱心だったから、\\n声をかけづらくてさ。"

    old "Mm, I did slack off a bit, though.{#ch5_6_v3002}"
    new "まぁ、結構練習さぼっちゃったしね。"

    old "Ah hah hah hah...{#ch5_6_v9934}"
    new "あははは……。"

    old "I was worried about Kirche.{#ch5_6_v9935}"
    new "キュルケのこと、心配したんだぞ。"

    old "Oh? Did you worry about me?{#ch5_6_v3003}"
    new "あら？\\n心配してくれたんだ。"

    old "Of course!{#ch5_6_v9936}"
    new "あたりまえだろ！"

    old "Really? I knew you'd come back, so I wasn't worried at all.{#ch5_6_v9937}"
    new "そうか？\\n俺はキュルケが戻ってくるって信じてたから、\\n心配なんてしてなかったぞ。"

    old "Really? I kinda felt like you were the most nervous of all, Hiraga-kun.{#ch5_6_v1951}"
    new "本当？\\n一番おどおどしていたの、\\n平賀くんだったような気がするけど。"

    old "B-baka. Don't say that.{#ch5_6_v9938}"
    new "ば、ばか。\\nそんなこと言うなって。"

    old "Really now, darling. You could just say it honestly.{#ch5_6_v3004}"
    new "もう、ダーリンったら。\\n素直に言ってもいいのよ。"

    old "W-was that so?{#ch5_6_v9939}"
    new "そ、そうだっけ？"

    old "That hurts~. Does it matter to you whether I'm here or not?{#ch5_6_v3005}"
    new "ひどーい。\\nあたしがいてもいなくても同じってこと？"

    old "Hiraga-kun, that's so mean~~!!{#ch5_6_v1952}"
    new "平賀くん、それヒドイよ～～！！"

    old "I'm sorry.{#ch5_6_v9940}"
    new "ごめんなさい。"

    old "But, there's no need for you to practice this hard until the day of the show...{#ch5_6_v9941}"
    new "でも、こんな日まで練習しなくても\\nいいのに……。"

    old "It's practice to make up for lost time. The more, the better.{#ch5_6_v3006}"
    new "遅れを取り戻すための練習だもの。\\nどれだけやっても、足りないことはないわ。"

    old "And... I'm the one holding everyone back the most...{#ch5_6_v1953}"
    new "それに……。\\n私も一番足を引っ張ってるし……。"

    old "Oh my, you're aware?{#ch5_6_v3007}"
    new "あら、自覚あるんだ？"

    old "That's mean! Kirche-sama!{#ch5_6_v1954}"
    new "ヒドイです！\\nキュルケさん！"

    old "It'll be all right. If you've got the will to do it, you'll make it.{#ch5_6_v9942}"
    new "大丈夫だよ。\\nそれだけやる気があればなんとかなるって。"

    old "That's right. As my darling says.{#ch5_6_v3008}"
    new "そうそう。\\nダーリンの言う通りよ。"

    old "Yes...{#ch5_6_v1955}"
    new "はい……。"

    old "Hey, Guiche!{#ch5_6_v9943}"
    new "おいっ、ギーシュ！"

    old "Oh, Saito?{#ch5_6_v4993}"
    new "あら、サイト？"

    old "W-what, is it you?{#ch5_6_v1443}"
    new "な、なんだ、きみか？"

    old "What are you doing with Louise! Where's Montmorency?{#ch5_6_v9944}"
    new "ルイズに何をしてるんだよ！\\nモンモランシーはどうしたんだ？"

    old "Hey, Louise.{#ch5_6_v9945}"
    new "おいっ、ルイズ。"

    old "What is it, Saito?{#ch5_6_v4994}"
    new "なによ、サイト。"

    old "Why are you walking around together with Guiche?{#ch5_6_v9946}"
    new "なんで、ギーシュと一緒に\\n歩いてるんですか？"

    old "What, you're asking in a bitter tone? There's nothing to it.{#ch5_6_v4995}"
    new "何、卑屈になって聞いてるのよ。\\n別になんでもないわよ。"

    old "...Ouch! Who is it! To think you'd throw a rock at me!{#ch5_6_v1444}"
    new "……痛てっ！\\nだ、誰だ！\\nこのぼくに石を投げるとは！"

    old "Saito, what are you doing?{#ch5_6_v4996}"
    new "サイト、何してるのよ？"

    old "Whoa! I've been caught! ...I-I'm sorry.{#ch5_6_v9947}"
    new "うわっ！\\n見つかった！\\n……ご、ごめんなさい。"

    old "We were just sent shopping by Wealthy-sama! Honestly!{#ch5_6_v1445}"
    new "ぼく達はただ、ウェザリーに買い物を\\n頼まれただけだ！\\nまったく！"

    old "O-oh really?{#ch5_6_v9948}"
    new "そ、そうなのか？"

    old "That's right. Guiche is just carrying the bags for me.{#ch5_6_v4997}"
    new "そういうわけ。\\nギーシュはただの荷物持ちよ。"

    old "Y-you can say that so confidently...? Hmm...{#ch5_6_v1446}"
    new "そ、そう断言されるとちょっと……。"

    old "T-then why didn't you ask me to help!?{#ch5_6_v9949}"
    new "だ、だったら俺に頼めよ！"

    old "Oh? Could it be... you're jealous?{#ch5_6_v4998}"
    new "あれ？\\nもしかして、ヤキモチなの？"

    old "I-I don't think so...{#ch5_6_v9950}"
    new "そ、そんなことないけどさ……。"

    old "Then, shall I have you help me carry the bags? Guiche alone isn't reliable enough.{#ch5_6_v4999}"
    new "だったら、荷物を持つの手伝って\\nもらおうかしら？\\nギーシュだけでは心もとないし。"

    old "O-ok, got it!{#ch5_6_v9951}"
    new "りょ、了解であります！"

    old "Just so you know... There are still more bags to carry.{#ch5_6_v5000}"
    new "言っておくけど……。\\nまだまだ荷物はあるんだからね！"

    old "H-haaai! Your ladyship!{#ch5_6_v9952}"
    new "は、は～～い！\\nご主人様！"

    old "Ah, Saito-san!{#ch5_6_v14463}"
    new "あ、サイトさん！"

    old "What are the two of you up to?{#ch5_6_v9953}"
    new "２人でどうしたの？"

    old "U-um, well...{#ch5_6_v14464}"
    new "え、ええとですね。"

    old "I'm learning to cook from Siesta.{#ch5_6_v3994}"
    new "シエスタにお料理を習ってるの。"

    old "Eh, is it okay to let it slip?{#ch5_6_v14465}"
    new "えっ、バラしちゃっていいんですか？"

    old "There's nothing suspicious about it.{#ch5_6_v3995}"
    new "別にやましいことはしてないもの。"

    old "Then, next time, let me try Montmon's cooking.{#ch5_6_v9954}"
    new "じゃあ、こんどモンモンの手料理を\\n食べさせてほしいな。"

    old "There's no way I'd cook for someone who calls me 'Montmon'.{#ch5_6_v3996}"
    new "モンモンなんて言ってる人に\\n食べさせる料理なんて無いわ。"

    old "Ouch...{#ch5_6_v9955}"
    new "あらら……。"

    old "What's your specialty?{#ch5_6_v9956}"
    new "得意な料理って何？"

    old "Hmm, I think pickled vegetables are the limit for now. Fried food and bread — I still have plenty of training to do.{#ch5_6_v3997}"
    new "うーん、まだ煮物が限界みたい。\\n焼き物とか、パンとか、\\nまだまだ修行が必要かもね。"

    old "Miss Montmonmon has natural talent, so I think you're just a little short.{#ch5_6_v14466}"
    new "ミス・モンモランシーは筋がいいんですから、\\nあと少しだと思いますよ。"

    old "Can you actually make something edible?{#ch5_6_v9957}"
    new "ちゃんと食べられるモノを作れるの？"

    old "Mmm, that's rude. As of now, I'm able to make something edible.{#ch5_6_v3998}"
    new "まぁ、失礼ね。\\n今はちゃんと食べられるものを作れるように\\nなっているわ。"

    old "That's right. First of all, it's not that easy to make something that's not edible.{#ch5_6_v14467}"
    new "そうですよ。\\n第一、食べられないものなんて、\\nそう簡単に作れるものじゃないです。"

    old "I think that's a different meaning...{#ch5_6_v3999}"
    new "それは意味が違うと思うけど……。"

    old "So, in the end, you're going to treat Guiche, right?{#ch5_6_v9958}"
    new "やっぱり、最後にはギーシュにご馳走するの？"

    old "T-that is, it's just that... I mean...{#ch5_6_v4000}"
    new "そ、それはその……つまり……。"

    old "Really, Saito-san! Men shouldn't ask questions like that.{#ch5_6_v14468}"
    new "もう、サイトさん！\\n男の人はそういうことを聞いちゃ駄目ですよ。"

    old "I-is that how it is?{#ch5_6_v9959}"
    new "そ、そういうものなのかな？"

    old "That's right.{#ch5_6_v14469}"
    new "そうです。"

    old "Mmm, let's go with that.{#ch5_6_v9960}"
    new "まぁ、そういうことにしておきますか。"

    old "Thank you for your cooperation with this investigation.{#ch5_6_v463}"
    new "今回の調査のご協力に感謝します。"

    old "Yes.{#ch5_6_v15459}"
    new "はい。"

    old "U-um... It's such nice weather today, isn't it?{#ch5_6_v464}"
    new "え、ええと。\\nきょ、今日はいいお天気ですね。"

    old "Yes, it is.{#ch5_6_v15460}"
    new "そうですね。"

    old "…….{#ch5_6_v465}"
    new "……。"

    old "U-um, familiar~! You've come at just the right time.{#ch5_6_v466}"
    new "つ、使い魔さん！\\nいいところに来てくれました。"

    old "W-what's wrong, Your Highness? You're pulling me along... You were talking to Tabitha, weren't you?{#ch5_6_v9961}"
    new "ど、どうしたんですか、お姫さま。\\n俺のことひっぱって……。\\nタバサと話をしていたんじゃないですか？"

    old "I just couldn't keep the conversation going...{#ch5_6_v467}"
    new "ど、どうしても会話が続かなくて……。"

    old "Ah, Tabitha and...{#ch5_6_v9962}"
    new "ああ、タバサと……。"

    old "Alright. Let me try to fix it.{#ch5_6_v9963}"
    new "分かりました。\\n俺がなんとかしてみましょう。"

    old "Thank you very much!{#ch5_6_v468}"
    new "ありがとうございます！"

    old "T-Tabitha. By the way, what about the play casting?{#ch5_6_v9964}"
    new "タ、タバサ。\\nそういえばお芝居の配役はどうなるのかな？"

    old "I don't know.{#ch5_6_v15461}"
    new "分からない。"

    old "Right. Everyone's working hard, so anyone could be chosen.{#ch5_6_v469}"
    new "そ、そうですよね。\\nみんな頑張っていますし、\\n誰に決まってもおかしくないですわ。"

    old "…….{#ch5_6_v9965}"
    new "……。"

    old "Familiar~, that's not good, is it? The situation hasn't improved at all.{#ch5_6_v470}"
    new "使い魔さん、駄目じゃないですか？\\nあまり状況が好転していませんよ。"

    old "No, even when you say that, to me...{#ch5_6_v9966}"
    new "いや、俺にそう言われても……。"

    old "Tabitha, the weather is nice today.{#ch5_6_v9967}"
    new "タバサ、今日は天気がいいな。"

    old "Sunny.{#ch5_6_v15462}"
    new "晴れ。"

    old "Yes, it's nice weather. On days like this, I want to run around in the fields.{#ch5_6_v471}"
    new "ええ、いい天気ですね。\\nこういう天気の時は野原を\\n駆け回りたいですね。"

    old "Books are better.{#ch5_6_v15463}"
    new "本がいい。"

    old "…….{#ch5_6_v9968}"
    new "……。"

    old "Hey, Tabitha, your familiar..., what was its name again.{#ch5_6_v9969}"
    new "ほら、タバサ、お前の使い魔の…、\\nなんて言ったっけ。"

    old "Sylphid.{#ch5_6_v15464}"
    new "シルフィード。"

    old "Yes! That Sylphid. Where is it usually?{#ch5_6_v9970}"
    new "そう！\\nそのシルフィード。\\n普段はどこにいるんだ？"

    old "It's in the sky.{#ch5_6_v15465}"
    new "空の上にいる。"

    old "That's right. It's really up in the sky.{#ch5_6_v472}"
    new "本当です。\\n空にちゃんといます。"

    old "You've always been together.{#ch5_6_v9971}"
    new "いつも一緒にいたんだな。"

    old "With Saito.{#ch5_6_v15466}"
    new "サイトと一緒。"

    old "Tabitha likes to read books, doesn't she?{#ch5_6_v9972}"
    new "タバサは本を読むのが好きなんだよな。"

    old "Yes.{#ch5_6_v15467}"
    new "うん。"

    old "Yes, it's nice weather. On days like this, I want to run around in the fields.{#ch5_6_v473}"
    new "だったら、今度王宮の書庫に来てみては\\nいかがですか？"

    old "That's right. It's really up in the sky.{#ch5_6_v474}"
    new "持ち出しや、見せることができない本も\\nありますが、ある程度の本は\\nお見せできると思いますよ。"

    old "…….{#ch5_6_v15468}"
    new "……。"

    old "Hmm. I think I have some idea now of how to talk to Tabitha-san.{#ch5_6_v475}"
    new "うーん。\\nなんとなくタバサさんとの会話の方法、\\n分かったような気がします。"

    old "R-really?{#ch5_6_v9973}"
    new "そ、そうですか？"

    old "I'm sorry.{#ch5_6_v15469}"
    new "ごめんなさい。"

    old "N-no, it's not Tabitha's fault. Next time, let's all talk a bit more.{#ch5_6_v9974}"
    new "い、いや、タバサのせいじゃねーって。\\n今度、もう少しみんなで話そうぜ。"

    old "Yes.{#ch5_6_v15470}"
    new "うん。"

    old "...Huh? Wealthy-sama?{#ch5_6_v9975}"
    new "……あれ？\\nウェザリーさん？"

    old "Ah, Saito...{#ch5_6_v15874}"
